  "details": "A recent update has changed the near clipping plane to something much bigger than before.\nNot exactly sure when but I was messaged about an avatar I had made a while ago no longer being usable for them because the menu in their hand would not display anymore. They also brought up that the hands on the model where disappearing up close as well.\nThe avatar in question is one of my ferret avatars I had made a while ago. Perfectly fine before but seems to break things now.\nCan be replicated by using a small avatar around ferret sized.",
